==English==

===Adjective===
'''aground'''

# {{nautical}} Resting on the [[bottom]]. (refers only to [[floating]] [[craft]]) (FM 55-501).
# {{1811}} Stuck fast, stopped, at a loss, ruined; like a boat or vessel aground.

===Adverb===
'''aground'''

# {{nautical}} Resting on the [[bottom]]. (refers only to floating craft). (FM 55-501).

